  "_notes": [
    "Copy this file to .env.authenticated.json beside the suite .env and replace placeholders using dedicated test accounts. JSON credentials must be env: references.",
    "Live work requires target=live, liveMutations=true, explicit action and exact recipient/folder allowlists. Allowed action names: navigation, compose, edit, post, send, upload, delete, share, rename, reply, forward, download, create.",
    "For WhatsApp and Telegram, expose your own account profile/settings phone number and the exact recipient's contact details before preflight. Their conversation title is insufficient identity proof.",
    "The read-only identity observer never clicks to reveal account details. Operator-verified identitySelector/identityAttribute and recipientIdentitySelector/recipientIdentityAttribute may bind a changed UI; a selector alone never bypasses exact value checks.",
    "Drive operates only within the designated disposable folder. Keep that exact URL in allowedDestinations. The runner supplies a uniquely marked fixture filename and revisedFilename.",
    "When a cloud browser cannot expose independent DOM, use a local observer or explicit identity-backed private manual evidence. Model completion text alone cannot pass.",
    "Live selectors are provisional. A missing identity, canonical item ID, safe cleanup proof, or checkpoint capability blocks that operation; fixture passes do not claim real-account success."
  ]
